// Units. `domain`: Ground units live on a planet's surface, Space units fly between planets.
// `builds`: buildings this unit can construct (a colonizer founds the building on another planet).
// Weapons: `ground` / `space` say what the weapon can hit, `kind` is the damage type
// (data/combat.ron), `splash` a radius in metres. Times are seconds.
// `armor_class` / `armor` / `shield` / `shield_regen`: see data/combat.ron.
// `sensors`: sight, radar, seismic, deep (space), detect (reveals stealth) — ranges in metres.
// `tech`: research needed (data/research.ron). `tags`: what research effects target
// ("unit" and "ground" / "ship" are added automatically).
